    }
)

st.subheader("Known Limitations")
st.markdown(
    """
- Trained on a single country (Luxembourg) — generalization to other regions/sensors is limited (domain shift)
- Performs best on Sentinel-2-style imagery; not designed for high-resolution aerial/drone photos
- Slight over-thickening and occasional spurious lines in visually dense areas with mixed roads/buildings
"""
)

